# Normalise line endings in the repository itself. The client and both container
# images are built on Linux, so keeping LF in the index and in every checkout stops
# CRLF creeping into files that Linux tooling reads (nginx.conf, Dockerfiles).
* text=auto eol=lf

*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.dll binary
*.pdb binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
